WEBVTT

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:49.250
It's raining.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:58.880
You'll catch a cold.

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:14.150
I don't mind the rain.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.490
Neither do I.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:36.670
<i>It was during the rainy season eight years ago,</i>

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:41.180
<i>right as I was training alone.</i>

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.850
<i>That was when I first met...</i>

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:49.850
<i>Takeru-sama.</i>

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:51.440
Inaho-chan.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:56.020
What's wrong, Takeru-sama?

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:58.940
No, um, you see.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:03.450
Our next class will be Element self practice, in the gym.

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:08.950
Sorry, I'll go right away.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.580
Takeru-sama.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:15.460
What?

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.380
It was raining on that day, too.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.590
That day?

00:03:21.590 --> 00:03:24.050
It was raining just like this.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.690
I wonder what's wrong.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.480
Inaho-chan's different from usual.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.480
Good, everyone sit down.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:42.490
Concentrate your will onto your crystal ball.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:50.870
A dark fog is in the crystal ball.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.040
That is the Element.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.630
Calling it out is easy, but controlling it is hard.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:01.010
First, try to focus the fog to the center of the ball.

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:07.890
Wow, that's great.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:11.470
The fog's all in the middle.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.400
This is pretty hard.

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.110
It returns to its earlier state once you get distracted for a bit.

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:21.820
It seems like Haruko-senpai can control it all at once.

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.110
Haru-nee's different.

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.780
She can control such an awesome Maken, after all.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:33.660
Speaking of Haruko-senpai, what happened to the perpetrator of those violent incidents?

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:38.750
She can't remember anything she did.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:43.760
Just like her victims, her memory has been altered by a third person.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:47.430
Hm, did she really lose her memories?

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.010
Hey.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:53.020
What are you whispering about in my class?

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.180
Ouch.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.440
S-Sorry.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:59.520
You'll both suffer later if you underestimate exercising with this crystal.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:04.860
Knowing how to use an Element is more useful than the Maken itself.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.780
Huh?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.160
Do you want me to demonstrate?

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.080
Um, I didn't say that.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:12.870
I understand.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:15.040
And since you begged for it, I'll demonstrate it for you.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.710
Kurigusa.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.630
Me?

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.540
Come on.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.090
Is the principal serious?

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:28.800
By using Maken Steel, my body becomes harder than steel.

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.970
If you're not careful, your knuckles will hurt.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.180
A child doesn't need to worry about adults.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.440
Actually, you should absorb my hits with caution,

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.650
or you'll be hurt badly otherwise.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.230
First are the feet.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.820
Then the waist.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:50.110
Focus the Element to your knuckles.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:54.290
Imagine your body being circled.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:59.710
By doing that, you can do this even without a Maken.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.590
Just like this.

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.760
And there you have it.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.010
That's impossible for us!

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:19.810
As expected of the principal's Element.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.270
It was really powerful.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:27.280
Oh, I may have overdone it a little.

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:29.240
Kurigasa-san,

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.700
are you all right?

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.700
What?

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:34.280
This is nothing.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.040
I'm very durable.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.040
It's no problem.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.540
<i>I'm all right.</i>

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:46.130
<i>My head's pretty durable.</i>

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:54.550
<i>Back then, Takeru-sama...</i>

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.310
Huh? Shopping?

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:03.440
Yes. It'll take me some time to sort the files of the student council today.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.940
I put a shopping list and money in that envelope,

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.990
so I'll be counting on you.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.870
Will the rain stop soon?

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:31.170
That's cool, Inaho-chan.

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:32.380
Aren't you scared?

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.590
Not a bit.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:35.800
You should try it, Takeru-kun.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.470
Inaho, where are you?

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.600
See you later, Takeru-kun.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:41.600
Bye bye.

00:07:57.370 --> 00:07:59.950
Um, Inaho-chan,

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:04.370
Haru-nee asked me to buy food for dinner.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:06.580
Can you come with me?

00:08:06.580 --> 00:08:10.550
Yes. I understand, Takeru-sama.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:40.830
Asking you to help me was definitely a good choice, Inaho-chan.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:44.830
I can bought some new snacks too, so I'm really happy.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.220
I'm Ooyama Takeru.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.260
I'm Inaho.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.730
Um, Takeru-sama, what's wrong?

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.820
Inaho-chan, listen.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.110
Y-Yes.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:19.320
Actually, this whole time, since we started shopping, I've been...

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:20.700
What is it?

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:22.830
I've been holding it back.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:23.700
That.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:27.000
"That" is?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:30.500
Please, I can't hold it back any longer.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.590
Just there, in that park.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:36.670
I want to do that, Inaho-chan.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.720
It's fine if I do it, right?

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:45.140
Oh god, it's true that we're engaged, but...

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:54.440
But if you want to do it no matter what, Takeru-sama, I will...

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.940
Sorry, hold this.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:58.280
I'll be going first.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.280
Takeru-sama?

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:09.170
Sorry, I had to go urgently.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.790
I'm glad you made it.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.460
Still, it's raining pretty hard.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.300
Yeah, it was raining like this on that day too.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:20.550
That day?

00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.050
What day?

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.060
Don't you remember?

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.680
It's related to you.

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:28.770
To me?

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.610
Rain, rain.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.110
You can't remember?

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.650
Could you give me a hint, at least.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:40.320
A hint?

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:41.950
Um...

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:44.530
How about "swing?"

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:45.540
"Swing."

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.120
"Swing," huh?

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.080
There's none here.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.330
Sorry, give me another hint.

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.540
"Promise."

00:10:56.630 --> 00:11:00.340
Could it be, that what's related to me is...

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:04.850
That's right, the first time Takeru-sama and I...

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:07.850
Uh, what was it?

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:10.520
Is it something that happened recently?

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:15.150
Oh well, I give up.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.360
I can't remember anything.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.490
Answer me.

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:23.030
I can't do that.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:26.830
If you don't remember, Takeru-sama...

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.910
if I'm the only one who remembers,

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:33.370
it'd be too boring.

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:39.050
I understand, I'll tell you when I remember.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:43.340
Look, it's raining harder.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.640
We should...

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:52.020
Hey, let's return to the dorm and continue our talk there...

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:57.020
Takeru-sama, please go ahead.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:59.900
Could it be that you're angry?

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:02.950
It's not like that.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:06.160
I want to stay here a little longer.

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.530
Inaho-chan...

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:12.460
It's all right, I'll go back soon.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.040
But...

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.630
Please let me.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:22.010
I beg you, Takeru-sama.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.980
This may be selfish of me

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:43.360
but, I want him to remember

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.490
because that memory is my...

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:55.620
My precious promise.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:01.250
<i>Were you slacking again?</i>

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.720
<i>Today, I'll thoroughly train you.</i>

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.720
<i>Stand up, are you tired already?</i>

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.220
<i>Stand up, Inaho!</i>

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:12.270
Stop it.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.430
Stop it...

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:22.980
Maken-Ki!

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:28.740
Maken-Ki!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.720
Just now, was that...

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:05.900
Takeru-sama doesn't remember that time or that promise anymore.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:17.870
Are you alone?

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.500
Let's go together.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:30.840
It's been raining for several days already.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.510
This is bad.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.230
My room is full of laundry.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.230
I'm back.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.150
Eh?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:47.940
So, you're saying you came home and left Inaho-chan on her own?

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.740
Since she said so.

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:55.990
Even so, isn't she a little late?

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.080
Ooyama Takeru,

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.580
although I don't know what happened between you and Inaho,

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:09.630
those who're bonded shall find each other even when separated by a thousand kilometers.

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:15.140
Those who are not shall be strangers even when meeting everyday.

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:23.440
If Inaho is your financée, you must have some kind of bond with her.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:28.400
Shouldn't you treasure Inaho's feelings?

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.490
I'll go look for her.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.580
Usui.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.420
Is Inaho-chan back?

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.750
Why do you ask?

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.170
I just saw Inaho-chan walking alone on the road.

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.970
Where did you see her? In the park?

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:57.810
So it's because of you.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:01.810
It couldn't have been different, since she loves you so much.

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:02.980
Where did you see her?

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:09.150
She headed from the shopping district to Amanohara, drenched from the rain.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.900
What did you do to her?

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:13.900
Nothing.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.370
Would doing nothing make a girl cry?

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:23.120
Inaho-chan cried?

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.040
Yeah.

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:27.330
But Usui, I...

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:29.960
It doesn't matter what the reason was.

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:35.180
I can't forgive you who made such a pure and gentle girl cry!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:42.220
I-I can't forgive myself, either!

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:53.990
I'm a pervert and a useless man, but you're even worse!

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.070
I'm in a hurry.

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:58.820
Move!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:10.040
And I always thought you were an idiot and pervert.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:11.880
You changed your view?

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:13.300
Just a little.

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:15.050
Stingy.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.010
By the way, what did you buy?

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:20.640
Was it okay that it got wet?

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.350
Ah, it's fine.

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.480
No biggie.

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:28.770
It's wrapped in plastic inside.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.570
No way.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:40.030
You perverted stupid rotten useless man!

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.370
Yes, just like you said.

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.130
<i>I can't do that.</i>

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.550
<i>If you didn't remember, Takeru-sama...</i>

00:17:54.510 --> 00:17:56.090
<i>if I'm the only one who remembers,</i>

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.090
<i>it'd be too boring.</i>

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:02.720
Sorry, I've forgotten such an important thing.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.430
I'm sorry for saying thoughtless things.

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:16.740
Are you hungry?

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:19.950
I'm hungry, too.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.240
It's weird.

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:27.250
That you'll still get hungry even when you're sad.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.000
Inaho-chan!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.670
That voice.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:37.130
Kitty, why are you running?

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:37.920
Hold on.

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:41.550
Inaho-chan, where are you?

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:50.690
Are you looking for someone, too?

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:58.110
<i>No, I won't make it.</i>

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.990
<i>Imagine your body being circled.</i>

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.670
That was close.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:15.540
Oh no.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:21.550
Maken Knuckle Kamudo,

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:26.760
Secret Art: One Hit Strike.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.660
Thank you, Takeru-sama,

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.660
for protecting the little one.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.210
Inaho-chan!

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.210
Get a hold of yourself.

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.790
Inaho-chan, get a hold of yourself.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.590
What happened?

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.320
Doesn't it hurt?

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:23.150
I'm all right.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:26.280
My head's pretty durable.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.240
I'm the same as you now.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:39.750
When I grow up, I'll become your wife, Takeru-kun!

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:46.220
When I grow up, I'll become much stronger than I am now,

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.180
and I'll protect you, Inaho-chan.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.360
Takeru-sama, this is...

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:01.730
You don't want to?

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:03.440
No, not at all.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:09.450
Sorry, I couldn't remember my promise with you, Inaho-chan.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:15.330
But I'll try my hardest to remember, so could you wait for a little more?

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:16.330
Yes.

00:21:16.330 --> 00:21:25.840
Also, I'll get stronger one day so you don't always have to save me.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.220
So I can protect you.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:42.780
Deep inside, Takeru-sama hasn't forgotten what he said to me back then.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:47.450
His feelings haven't changed.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:52.530
That's why I'm very happy with just this.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:00.710
This cuteness is truly a crime.

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:02.590
Seriously, we were so worried.

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:04.710
Sorry.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:08.720
Do you want to talk to us about anything?

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:11.930
I'm all right.

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:14.390
I see.

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:17.350
Monji likes me, after all.

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:18.980
Monji?

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:21.520
I got it from the cross on his head.

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:24.320
How simple.

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:28.860
In that aspect, humans and cats are the same because

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:31.660
they wish to be by the one they love.

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.950
Himegami-san, what do you mean by that?

00:22:35.950 --> 00:22:39.370
I didn't mention anything about you.

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:43.040
Haruko-senpai, your face is red.

00:22:43.040 --> 00:22:45.750
That's because it's hot in the bath.

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:50.630
Can't you go any faster than this?

00:24:29.440 --> 00:24:31.440
I'm kitty friend Himegami Kodama.

00:24:32.030 --> 00:24:33.450
Although the first semester is almost over,

00:24:33.740 --> 00:24:35.450
someone seems to have fallen from the sky.

00:24:36.450 --> 00:24:38.450
There is nothing to predict now.

00:24:38.450 --> 00:24:42.450
Having two stupid boys in Tenbi is enough.
